NAME: inner let shadows an outer variable
DESCRIPTION: the inner (store x) places only the inner x; ADD 4 x writes the outer x's A-field (.A); fixed in i-7d2612-ce4c3b, see behtests/let_shadowing.beh
SRC:
(let (x 1)
  (seq
    (JMP (Dir 3))
    (DAT (store x) 0)
    (let (x 2)
      (DAT 0 (store x)))
    (ADD 4 x) ))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  JMP    $3     , #0     
_LET1 
  DAT    #1     , #0     
_LET8 
  DAT    #0     , #2     
  ADD.A  #4     , $_LET1 
  DAT    #0     , #0     